          "thread": "Bitcoin DeFi yield integrations",
          "why": "The emergence of LRT vaults, tokenized-BTC lending, and impermanent-loss solutions for wrapped Bitcoin signaled that BTC holders are being pulled into DeFi risk profiles they did not historically sign up for."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Sovereign and corporate accumulation",
          "why": "From MicroStrategy to nine governments to Trump and Senator Lummis pitching a strategic reserve, readers engaged heavily with Bitcoin as a geopolitical and balance-sheet asset rather than a retail trade."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Bitcoin collateral governance failures",
          "why": "USDD removing 12,000 BTC from collateral without DAO approval crystallized reader anxiety about opaque governance in protocols that use Bitcoin as backing."
