        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Bitcoin custody and security threats",
          "why": "Deepfake Bitcoin scam proliferation and the Bitcoin Fog mixing service conviction revealed a security threat landscape that is simultaneously technical, social-engineering-based, and regulatory."
